  "description": "Catch trail fever on the Shift R5 LT, featuring Haro's new 140 mm Long Travel 4-Bar Linkage All-Mountain frame, Rockshox suspension platform, and clean internal cable routing. Think about your line, not your drivetrain with an intuitive and lightweight 1x10 drive train featuring a new Shimano SLX rear derailleur.\nNew Shift R LT 6061-T6 alloy 4-Bar linkage frame, 140mm rear travel, tapered 1.5\" head tube, 73mm BB shell, 12mm thru-axle dropouts\nInternal cable routing\nRockShox Monarch R Solo Air 200X57 w/ rebound adjuster\nNew Rockshox Sektor Silver RS 27.5, Solo Air, 140mm travel, w/ remote lockout\nRitchey Comp Logic Zero Press-Fit 1-1/8\" / 1.5\" headset\nFSA Comet Modular crankset w/ 30T Megatooth Crmo Chainring\nNew Shimano SLX 1x10/11 rear derailleur, Shadow Plus\nShimano Deore 1x10 shifter\nSunRace 1x10-spd 11-42T cassette\nRitchey Trail handlebar, seat-post & Trail WCS Lock-Ring grips\nKenda Nevegal X 27.5x2.35, 60tpi tires\nUpper chain guide",
